the contamination?

276
00:23:09,632 --> 00:23:12,802
Yeah. Come on,
you're killing me with questions here.

277
00:23:13,010 --> 00:23:14,846
You got a sweet deal here, you know?

278
00:23:15,012 --> 00:23:18,141
Because you're, you know,
like, special.

279
00:23:18,349 --> 00:23:20,017
